          %p
            (e.g.
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#EKMM97"} EKMM 97, VII lemma 1.3
          .proof
            %h6#proof_6 Proof
            %p
              In one direction, consider a
              = succeed "-algebra" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
