                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (A,\mu_A, e_A) \longrightarrow (E, \mu_E, e_E\circ e_A)
            %p
              Now for the converse direction, assume that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
