                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f_x \;\colon\; F_1(x) \longrightarrow F_2(x)
                of the underlying functors
            %p
              compatible with the product and the unit in that the following
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/commuting+diagram"} diagrams commute
              for all objects
