          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_3 Remark
            %p
              In the literature the term “monoidal functor” often refers by default to what in def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#LaxMonoidalFunctor"}
              is called a strong monoidal functor. But for the purpose of the discussion of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/functors+with+smash+product"} functors with smash product
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "#FunctorsWithSmashProduct"} below
            %p
